# ============================================================
# Pwn Writeups .gitignore
#
# Git cannot inspect file headers, so .gitignore cannot directly
# say "ignore extensionless ELF". Use deny-all + whitelist:
#   - extensionless files (including challenge ELF) are ignored
#   - source, docs, images and common config are explicitly kept
#   - no per-challenge filename maintenance is needed
# ============================================================

# 1. 默认忽略全部文件，但保留目录以便继续遍历。
*
!*/

# 2. 白名单：源码、文档、配置和图片。
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.gitmodules
!*.py
!*.pyi
!*.pyw
!*.c
!*.C
!*.h
!*.H
!*.cc
!*.cpp
!*.cxx
!*.hpp
!*.hh
!*.hxx
!*.s
!*.S
!*.asm
!*.ld
!*.mk
!Makefile
!makefile
!GNUmakefile
!Dockerfile
!*.md
!*.MD
!*.markdown
!*.rst
!*.txt
!*.pdf
!*.tex
!*.bib
!*.ipynb
!*.sh
!*.bash
!*.zsh
!*.ps1
!*.bat
!*.cmd
!*.json
!*.jsonc
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.toml
!*.ini
!*.cfg
!*.conf
!*.properties
!*.sql
!*.html
!*.htm
